{"type":"text","timestamp":1791729669728,"sessionID":"ses_ed4c1117bffebZ7GXJEsWgJE6P","part":{"id":"prt_12b68e90f001lgMuzJeQK5i6Uh","messageID":"msg_12b68d7f2001rYG2SUTWv1Vepk","sessionID":"ses_ed4c1117bffebZ7GXJEsWgJE6P","type":"text","text":"All tasks complete. Summary of the job:\n\n## Done — New \"Modern\" theme (Notion-inspired)\n\n**TASK-1 `static/themes/modern/modern.css`** — Full light-only token set:\n- **System font stack** (Notion ships no webfont: `-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, ...`) for `--t-font-body`/`--t-font-heading`/`--font-sans`\n- Notion palette: blue accent `#2383e2`, warm near-black text `#37352f`, red `#d44c47`, green `#0f7b6c`, yellow `#cb912f`\n- White canvas `#ffffff`, warm-gray sidebar `#f7f6f3`, whisper hairline borders `rgba(0,0,0,0.1)`, restrained multi-layer shadows\n- Warm Notion gray scale (gray-700 = body text `#37352f`), `--color-s-dark*` remapped to light values, `html.dark` light-enforcement block, subtle `.logo` desaturation\n- **Radii untouched** — only the nav goes square, per the y2k-gimmick guardrail\n\n**TASK-2 `src/lib/config/themes.ts`** — Registered `Modern` (last entry, `default` stays first), `supportsDarkMode: false`, four hex preview fields matching the palette.\n\n**TASK-3 Nav overrides in `modern.css`, scoped to nav hook classes only** — Desktop + mobile: containers `padding: 0` (flush to window edge), bars `border-radius: 0` + `box-shadow: none` + `filter: none` (kills `drop-shadow-xl`), flat `#f7f6f3` fills; hover/active `rgba(55,53,47,0.06/0.08)` + `#37352f` text stay legible. **Stated decision:** the mobile overflow popover stays rounded and is restyled as a Notion menu (white + hairline border) — the \"flat bar\" requirement targets the nav bar, not floating overlays.\n\n**TASK-4 Verification** — `npm run check`: 0 errors/warnings · theme tests 20/20 · eslint clean · dev server serves the theme CSS with no console errors · **Playwright harness against the real compiled app CSS + verbatim navbar DOM** measured: padding `4px→0px`, radius `6px→0px`, gradient→flat gray, drop-shadow removed, Notion hover/active fills, system font applied. Screenshots saved for the pipeline.\n\n**Known issues (recorded in `implementation.md`):**\n- `npm run lint` / 6 Vitest failures are **pre-existing** (reproduced against the pristine base `themes.ts` — 494 prettier-dirty files, date-sensitive `DateHelperExtended` tests, `StatisticWidget` DOM query)\n- `vite build` OOM-killed in this sandbox during final gzip (1964 modules transform fine — environment limitation, not a code issue)\n- No backend API here, so the authenticated in-app navbar couldn't be exercised live; cascade verified via harness instead\n\nAll work committed on `feature/perform_new-theme-modern` (matches `brief.md`); worktree left clean apart from the pipeline's continuously-appended `session.log`. Not pushed, not merged.","time":{"start":1791729658127,"end":1791729669722}}}
